# Environment variables for spot.service (systemd EnvironmentFile format).
#
# Empty by default. The daemon's own configuration belongs in spot.toml; use
# this file only for deployment-specific variables such as RUST_LOG or a proxy
# setting. One KEY=VALUE per line, no `export`, no shell quoting.
#
# If a value is a secret, set the file mode to 0600 root:spot. Never commit a
# populated copy of this file.
